          "y": 0.24,
          "w": 0.88,
          "h": 0.5,
          "text": "\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item A proof without polar coordinates?\n\\item Which other integrals yield to squaring?\n\\item Higher dimensions: $\\int_{\\mathbb{R}^n} e^{-|x|^2}\\,dx = \\pi^{n/2}$\n\\end{enumerate}",
          "font_pt": 19,
          "font_family": "",
          "color": "#000000",
